    <h2 class="section-heading">Choosing the right features</h2>
    <p>The ReliaGear RD lighting panelboards are factory assembled on rigid steel frames and equipped with circuit breakers from 15 A to 600 A with busbar options up to 600A main lug. The maximum short circuit rating is equal to 42 kAIC at 600V/347V AC and 42 kAIC 480/277 V AC.</p>

