                <li>Adaptive protection, data network logger, network analyzer and frequency protection</li>
                <li>Front display with an LCD screen to interface with breaker.</li>
                <li>Measurements (voltage, energy, power) as standard and 0.1% accuracy of energy and power readings.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

